ious book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 2,000 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 2,399 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #4",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/400 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/400 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 2,800 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 3,199 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #5",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/400 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/400 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 3,600 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 3,999 kills."}}},{["name"]="Sealed clue scroll (elite)",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="99/25,600",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="99/25,600",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="There's a 1% chance an elite clue scroll will be upgraded to a master clue scroll."}}},{["name"]="Sealed clue scroll (master)",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/25,600",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/25,600",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="There's a 1% chance an elite clue scroll will be upgraded to a master clue scroll."}}},{["name"]="Starved ancient effigy",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/12,093 – 1/60,467",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity